"""A port of WarpFactory, a toolkit that analyzes warp drive spacetimes.

WarpFactory is the MATLAB toolkit of Christopher Helmerich and Jared
Fuchs (MIT). It samples a metric on a grid, finds the stress-energy
tensor by the Einstein equations, and checks the energy conditions. The
original lives at https://github.com/NerdsWithAttitudes/WarpFactory, and
its method is in Helmerich et al., "Analyzing warp drive spacetimes with
Warp Factory", Classical and Quantum Gravity 41 (2024) 095009.

See the wiki page Warp drives.
"""
